OL,3,GNEWSA'My house was destroyed by a
OL,4,Agarden bonfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Robert Marsden, seeing his home go
OL,7,Fup in flames and almost completely
OL,8,Fdestroyed was "soul-destroying".
OL,10,FMarsden's house was part of a terrace
OL,11,Fin Sheffield which suffered major
OL,12,Fdamage after a neighbour's garden
OL,13,Fbonfire spread out of control during
OL,14,Fthe July heatwaves.
OL,16,FMarsden lost around 70% of his family
OL,17,Fhome and even slept inside the charred
OL,18,Fshell for two weeks after burglars
OL,19,Ftargeted one of the other damaged
OL,20,Fhouses.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
