OL,3,GNEWSA'My house was destroyed by a
OL,4,Agarden bonfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "It was just soul-destroying
OL,7,Fto see everything that you've got for
OL,8,Fyour family, gone - and it was gone in
OL,9,Fminutes."
